<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <RootNamespace>PictureSharp.Formats.Jxl</RootNamespace>
    <IsAotCompatible>true</IsAotCompatible>
    <IsTrimmable>true</IsTrimmable>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <AllowUnsafeBlocks>false</AllowUnsafeBlocks>
    <PackageId>PictureSharp.Jxl</PackageId>
    <Description>Pure C# JPEG XL plugin for PictureSharp. Detects and identifies JPEG XL files (raw codestream and container), decodes still lossy (VarDCT, XYB) and lossless (Modular) images, including recompressed JPEGs, patches and progressive files, encodes images lossily (VarDCT with quality, distance and effort 1-9, about as small as cjxl, the default) or losslessly (8-bit or 16-bit Modular, about as small as cjxl -d 0 -e 7), losslessly transcodes sequential and progressive 8-bit JPEG with byte-exact original reconstruction, and reads, writes and edits the ICC profile, EXIF and XMP (also Brotli-compressed).</Description>
    <PackageTags>picturesharp;image;jxl;jpegxl</PackageTags>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/art-ix/picturesharp.jxl</PackageProjectUrl>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>0.8.12: Image.Load decodes JPEG XL animations into multi-frame images: every frame djxl shows with its default coalescing, as a full canvas after blending, with its duration (ticks converted exactly to TimeSpan) and the loop count. Identify reports the number of frames. Every frame is reserved before it is allocated (MaxPixels sums them), MaxFrames counts every stored frame (also with FirstFrameOnly, which decodes only the first frame), and working memory stays that of one layered image. Frames match djxl (lossless exactly, lossy within 1 of 255), identical at 1 and many threads. Still images are unchanged. See docs/releases/release-0.8.12.md and docs/design/0.8.12-animation.md.</PackageReleaseNotes>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup><PackageReference Include="PictureSharp" Version="$(PictureSharpVersion)" /></ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="../../LICENSE" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
    <None Include="../../THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
    <None Include="../../README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
